      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(56,56,56,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>选取 RRT* 作为基线。其在机械臂高维构型空间中具备概率完备性，但直接应用于分拣任务存在以下不足：</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="232" width="360" height="130">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(56,56,56,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>· 随机采样导致初始可行解获取慢，规划时间长</p>
        <p>· 路径含冗余节点，转折多、不平滑</p>
        <p>· 仅以路径长度为代价，未考虑碰撞风险与执行效率</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="480" startY="150" endX="480" endY="430">
      <border color="rgba(183,183,183,1)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="140" width="370" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>本文改进策略</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="176" width="30" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
