      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="202" width="340" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(90,90,90,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <p>引入目标偏向采样与启发式引导，引导树向目标生长，加速初始可行解收敛。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="252" width="30" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>②</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="252" width="340" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(17,17,17,1)" bold="true">
        <p>综合代价函数</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="278" width="340" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(90,90,90,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <p>融合路径长度、关节运动平滑度与障碍距离，构造综合代价函数优化重选父节点。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="328" width="30" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>③</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="328" width="340" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(17,17,17,1)" bold="true">
        <p>路径剪枝与平滑</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="538" topLeftY="354" width="340" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(90,90,90,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <p>对规划路径进行冗余节点剪枝，并采用 B 样条插值平滑，生成可直接跟踪的连续轨迹。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="80" startY="430" endX="880" endY="430">
